From 191032015c2b6f529ee413898365a955ccf643f5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ewout van Mansom <ewout@vanmansom.name>
Date: Sat, 11 Apr 2026 22:07:36 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] feat: add Gemma 4 model support with FC-format tool
 descriptions

Add Gemma 4 provider transform (Google FC calling format), system prompt
adjustments for structured tool calling, essential tool filtering for
context-limited models, and shortDescription/shortHint fields on all
tools for concise FC-format presentation.
